### Gate 2: Static Typecheck Verification (oodac check)
  - All 289 files typechecked with `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/oodac_bin check`.
  - Removed phantom imports (`os/proc.oo`, `random.oo`, `sys.oo`), fixed unclosed braces in `rsa_pss_*.oo`, and resolved monomorphization type annotations.
  - Zero typecheck errors across all files (289/289 OK).

### Gate 3: MUST-GATE & Capability Model (SECURITY.oot & STDLIB_CRYPTO_MATH.oot)
  - All unaudited/complex crypto operations (ZKP, FHE, post-quantum crypto) fail closed with `process_exit(1)` stubs.
  - Pure cryptographic helpers (hex codecs, checksums, constant-time equality) execute natively without ambient authority.

### Gate 4 & 5: Behavioral Proof & End-to-End Execution
  - Executable test fixture: `std/wave3_proof.oo`.
  - Exercises HMAC-SHA256 evaluation, hex encoding/decoding, DJB2 checksums, and constant-time string comparisons.
  - End-to-end build via `ooda run` passes with status 0 (`WAVE3_INTEGRATION_SUITE_PASSED`).

